OL,3,ABid to run new trains on West Coast
OL,4,AMainline refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for new train services between
OL,7,FLondon and Wrexham, Rochdale and
OL,8,FBlackpool have been rejected by the
OL,9,FOffice of Rail and Road (ORR).
OL,11,FThe proposal to add more trains on the
OL,12,FWest Coast Main Line would "likely
OL,13,Fincrease delays and cancelled trains
OL,14,Ffor passengers", the regulator said.
OL,16,FIt rejected Wrexham, Shropshire and
OL,17,FMidlands Railway's application for four
OL,18,Fdaily Wrexham to London Euston return
OL,19,Fservices, as well as Lumo's proposal
OL,20,Ffor up to four return services between
OL,21,FRochdale and Euston on weekdays and
OL,22,FSaturdays, and three on Sundays.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
